ABOUT THIS WORK

The DMZ F2 Decomposition is original mathematics by Ahmad Ali Parr:

  Ramanujan black hole entropy reduced to F2 (field with 2 elements).
  Weil bounds = Riemann Hypothesis for finite fields as a lemma.
  Entropy <= 0.20 = Weil bound = the same inequality.

This formal Lean 4 proof encodes a result that exists in Ahmad's head
and in this repository. The mathematics is inseparable from the proof.
You cannot use one without the other.

Zero sorry. Lean 4 kernel verified.

